  "certified_type": {
    "category": "Automatic catchweigher",
    "type_designations": [
      "CWS™ Loadpin"
    ],
    "description": "Automatic catchweigher designed to weigh containers statically with no operator intervention. The instrument comprises Loadpin digital load cells, an interface unit (spreader unit) and a control and display unit (control unit). The load cells and electronics are permanently installed on the spreader of the container handler; weight values are transmitted from the load cells via the interface unit to the display unit and on to the Terminal Operating System (TOS). The interface and display units have aluminium enclosures; the display unit comprises a communications and display controller with an LCD display and 8 keys (6 functional control keys and 2 navigation keys). The units are powered by the container handler via a nominal 24 V DC external source; the interface unit supplies the strain gauge bridges of the load cells. Devices: semi-automatic zero-setting (≤ 4% Max) via user interface or TOS, long term storage device, display and storage of individual and total weights. Interfaces: link between interface and display unit, RS 232 / RS 422 / RS 485, CANBUS, Ethernet, Wifi. Software is protected by a version number and checksum held on the eMMC memory; access to legally relevant parameters is password-protected with a non-editable Config Version counter."
  },
